				Time="2011-11-03T11:24:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『破壊の魔神……？
力を　封印していた……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-11-03T11:24:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
